// ── PLAYER SPECIES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Class = combat role (PLAYER_CLASSES). Species = body and temperament: a stat
// tilt and HP tweak applied ONCE at creation, ONE passive trait set read live,
// a size, and how townsfolk react on first meeting. The live species is
// player.appearance.species, the same field Shapeshifter rewrites, so a
// shapeshift swaps TRAITS (and size, element traits, social reactions) but never
// the stats or HP the player already has.
//   playable: true  -> offered at character setup
//   playable: false -> basics only, reachable through Shapeshifter
// Trait keys (all optional, read with getPlayerSpeciesTrait):
//   crossTrainXpMult  XP multiplier for classes you did not pick (default 2)
//   manaRegenMult     passive mana regen multiplier
