// Every class has branches; every branch has three tiers (Basic, Advanced,
// Master). Basic and Advanced offer two techniques (pick one); Master is one
// capstone. A technique can be offered by two related branches ("shared"):
// learning it counts as the pick in both. `have` marks techniques that
// already exist in the engine today; the rest are filled in as they are built
// (`built: true` once the engine can actually use it).
